values ('48771e3f-311d-5c22-8d9c-fbec463c28ff', '0ed0e519-b65d-5a2d-b5d9-f05927907114', 'primary', 'BAYSTATE HALF MARATHON', 'race', true, 'The race converts fourteen weeks of restrained progression into a performance attempt. The highest-value outcome is a strong time plus a healthy finish and healthy recovery.', 'Warm-up 35-40 min before start: 10-12 min easy + mobility drills + 4x20 s strides; finish 8-10 min before 8:00 AM. Race using selected A/B/C plan; 8-10 min walk after.', 21.1, '1:22-1:30 plus warm-up', NULL, NULL, 'A 3:53/km avg; B 3:57-3:58/km; C controlled by RPE', 233, 233, 'Start 7, build to 8-9/10', 'Do not chase HR; expect high-180s/low-190s late if healthy', 'Official flat, paved double loop; bridges/turns; expect shared start', 'Calm early; smooth through halfway; form before force; compete after 15 km.', 'Breakfast 2.5-3.5 h before; gel ~10 min pre if tested; gel around 35-45 min; sip water/Gatorade as practiced.', 'Proven race shoe only; shoe: ______', 'distance 21.1 km; pace A 3:53/km avg; RPE Start 7, build to 8-9/10')
